| Pattern             | Meaning            |
| ------------------- | ------------------ |
| `[0-9]`             | one digit          |
| `[A-Z]`             | uppercase letter   |
| `[a-z]`             | lowercase letter   |
| `[A-Za-z]`          | any alphabet       |
| `\\d`               | digit              |
| `\\d+`              | one or more digits |
| `\\d{10}`           | exactly 10 digits  |
| `+`                 | 1 or more          |
| `*`                 | 0 or more          |
| `?`                 | 0 or 1             |
| `{n}`               | exactly n          |
| `{n,m}`             | n to m             |
| `\\b`               | word boundary      |
| `str_extract()`     | first match        |
| `str_extract_all()` | all matches        |
